OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car damaged in shop window 
OL,4,Acrash                                  
OL,6,FA police car smashed into a shop window
OL,7,Fin Kent, following a crash with another
OL,8,Fvehicle.                               
OL,10,FA Kent Police patrol was responding to 
OL,11,Fan emergency call shortly before 20:30 
OL,12,FGMT on Wednesday at the time of the    
OL,13,Fincident in Tunbridge Wells, according 
OL,14,Fto the force.                          
OL,16,FThe junction of Grosvenor Road and     
OL,17,FHanover Road in the Kent town was      
OL,18,Fclosed by police, after the police car 
OL,19,Fcollided with the window of the Dream  
OL,20,FDoors showroom.                        
